WEBVTT

00:00:14.898 --> 00:00:16.298
Are you in charge here?

00:00:16.598 --> 00:00:17.598
Yes, I am--
Nope!

00:00:17.658 --> 00:00:18.658
My--
Wrong!

00:00:19.378 --> 00:00:20.378
name--
I'm in charge!

00:00:20.378 --> 00:00:22.078
is Major--
Me!

00:00:22.078 --> 00:00:23.118
Ben--
[whispers]
I'm in charge.

00:00:25.118 --> 00:00:26.778
You've never seen
anything like this before.

00:00:27.818 --> 00:00:28.858
It says
I'm the top banana

00:00:29.517 --> 00:00:31.218
in a world full
of hungry
little monkeys.

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:33.098
Allow me to clarify.
[makes servo noise]

00:00:34.578 --> 00:00:36.078
In a sequentially
ranked hierarchy

00:00:36.078 --> 00:00:37.338
based on level
of critical importance,

00:00:37.458 --> 00:00:39.257
the disparity between us
is too vast to quantify.

00:00:39.678 --> 00:00:41.858
Agent Stone?
The Doctor thinks you're basic.

00:00:42.398 --> 00:00:43.878
I'm initiating a sweep sequence.

00:00:44.538 --> 00:00:46.798
Ten miles in every direction
should suffice.

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:47.885
[whirring]

00:00:47.958 --> 00:00:50.418
Is he still looking at me funny?
Yes, he is.

00:00:50.418 --> 00:00:52.078
Tell him to stop
or I'll pull up
his search history.

00:00:52.158 --> 00:00:53.358
If you don't stop looking
at the Doctor,

00:00:53.478 --> 00:00:55.538
he'll take a closer look--
I'm not deaf.

00:00:55.698 --> 00:00:57.318
And tell him his men
report to me now.

00:00:57.468 --> 00:00:59.027
Blah-blah-blah.

00:00:59.178 --> 00:01:01.598
Excuse me? Listen, pal,
I don't know if you realize--

00:01:01.598 --> 00:01:03.078
I'm sorry, Major.
What was your name?

00:01:03.078 --> 00:01:05.098
Benning--
Nobody cares!

00:01:06.238 --> 00:01:09.478
Nobody cares. Listen,
Major Nobody Cares.

00:01:09.898 --> 00:01:11.458
[whispering] You know why
nobody cares who you are?

00:01:12.077 --> 00:01:14.338
Because nobody cares about
your feeble accomplishments.

00:01:14.858 --> 00:01:17.418
And nobody cares
how proud your mommy is

00:01:17.418 --> 00:01:19.938
that you're now reading
at a third-grade level.

00:01:19.958 --> 00:01:22.218
Mmm.
Have you finished
Charlotte's Webyet?

00:01:22.578 --> 00:01:24.598
Spoiler alert:
She dies in the end.

00:01:24.898 --> 00:01:26.598
But she leaves
a big creepy egg sac.

00:01:26.744 --> 00:01:28.951
[machinery clicks, whirring]

00:01:29.098 --> 00:01:30.958
Ah... my babies.

00:01:31.538 --> 00:01:34.078
Whoo! Look what came out
of my egg sac.

00:01:34.517 --> 00:01:36.078
You know what I love
about machines?

00:01:37.438 --> 00:01:40.818
They do what they're told.
They follow their programming.

00:01:40.818 --> 00:01:43.458
They don't need time off
to get drunk

00:01:43.458 --> 00:01:44.458
and put the boat in the water.

00:01:45.298 --> 00:01:46.918
Now you do what you're told.

00:01:47.298 --> 00:01:49.558
Stand over there on the edge
of your personal abyss...

00:01:50.498 --> 00:01:52.638
and watch my machines
do your job.

00:01:55.198 --> 00:01:58.118
Can you feel it, Stone?
I can feel it, Doctor.

00:01:58.878 --> 00:01:59.878
It's evolution, Stone.
[drones whirring]

00:02:01.498 --> 00:02:02.498
It's evolution!

00:02:14.369 --> 00:02:16.919
[drone humming]

00:02:18.595 --> 00:02:20.969
[beeping]

00:02:38.707 --> 00:02:40.108
Agent Stone?
Doctor.

00:02:41.128 --> 00:02:43.028
Do you see anything useful
in this image?

00:02:44.327 --> 00:02:46.927
Nothing at all, Doctor.
Of course you don't.

00:02:47.287 --> 00:02:49.047
Your eyes weren't
expertly trained to spot tracks

00:02:49.047 --> 00:02:50.807
by the Native-American
Shadow Wolves.

00:02:50.915 --> 00:02:53.647
[beeping]

00:03:01.438 --> 00:03:02.478
That's extraordinary.

00:03:02.564 --> 00:03:04.730
No. What's extraordinary is,

00:03:05.218 --> 00:03:07.498
I've determined
the exact height, weight

00:03:07.678 --> 00:03:09.118
and spinal curvature
of this creature,

00:03:09.498 --> 00:03:11.738
and my computer
can't find a single match for it

00:03:11.738 --> 00:03:14.298
anywhere in Earth's
animal kingdom.

00:03:15.397 --> 00:03:17.617
This blackout
was not a terrorist attack,

00:03:17.938 --> 00:03:19.377
and that's no baby bigfoot.

00:03:20.198 --> 00:03:23.338
This guy is something else...

00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:26.338
entirely.

00:03:26.757 --> 00:03:29.097
Divert all search units
to the site of the footprint.

00:03:30.458 --> 00:03:32.358
That's one small step for man,

00:03:32.978 --> 00:03:35.058
one giant leap for me.

00:03:35.703 --> 00:03:38.322
[indistinct radio chatter]

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:44.460
[men chattering]
[dogs barking]

00:03:46.398 --> 00:03:48.638
Okay, okay, everything is fine.

00:03:48.878 --> 00:03:50.818
You played some baseball,
got a little upset,

00:03:50.958 --> 00:03:53.738
lightning shot out of your butt,
and now they're coming for you.

00:03:54.998 --> 00:03:56.757
All right, all right.
Earth isn't safe anymore.

00:03:57.098 --> 00:03:58.878
Time for plan B.
Mushroomville.

00:03:59.098 --> 00:04:02.218
But I gotta take my stuff.
Okay, essential items only.

00:04:02.358 --> 00:04:04.298
Okay, toothbrush, toothpaste,
hair gel, night-light.

00:04:04.498 --> 00:04:06.478
Funny hat.
This half-eaten cantaloupe.

00:04:06.778 --> 00:04:07.998
Oh, and my scented candle.

00:04:08.438 --> 00:04:10.638
My entire comic book collection.
Bean bag chair.

00:04:10.798 --> 00:04:12.058
Can a bean bag chair
fit in a backpack?

00:04:12.298 --> 00:04:13.738
No, no, no.
Of course not.
That's stupid.

00:04:14.278 --> 00:04:17.518
Okay, what else? The rings!
The rings, yes, of course.

00:04:19.038 --> 00:04:20.618
Here we go. Ring time.

00:04:20.878 --> 00:04:22.198
Mushroom planet, here I come.
[drones whirring]

00:04:23.118 --> 00:04:24.738
Oh, no.
They're right outside.

00:04:25.058 --> 00:04:26.138
I gotta go somewhere else.
[dogs barking]

00:04:30.389 --> 00:04:32.515
Goodbye, cave.

00:04:34.132 --> 00:04:37.490
[cell phone rings]

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:38.490
Hey.
[Maddie] Hey.

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:39.478
Whatcha doing?

00:04:39.478 --> 00:04:42.118
Just coloring
with Jojo and Rachel.

00:04:42.558 --> 00:04:44.278
Ah, that sounds...
half-fun.

00:04:44.698 --> 00:04:46.757
Hey, exciting stuff here.
We had a power outage.

00:04:47.158 --> 00:04:48.298
The whole town went dark.

00:04:48.958 --> 00:04:51.018
It was like a sign telling me
to get out of Dodge.

00:04:51.218 --> 00:04:52.998
Wade must have lost his mind.
Yeah.

00:04:53.438 --> 00:04:54.938
And he does not
have much to lose.

00:04:55.898 --> 00:04:58.198
How's your sister?
Did she convince you
to leave me yet?

00:04:58.398 --> 00:05:01.757
No, but she did tell me
to check your phone
for dating apps.

00:05:01.898 --> 00:05:03.938
The only apps on my phone
are the ones that came with it.

00:05:04.578 --> 00:05:05.838
And the Olive Garden.
[Maddie] Ah.

00:05:06.018 --> 00:05:07.438
Because when you're there...
You're family.

00:05:08.072 --> 00:05:09.863
[garbage cans clatter]

00:05:10.178 --> 00:05:11.178
No way.

00:05:13.798 --> 00:05:15.318
The raccoons are back.

00:05:15.498 --> 00:05:17.637
And they are in for a surprise.

00:05:17.698 --> 00:05:19.718
Your surprise better not be
my tranquilizer gun.

00:05:20.017 --> 00:05:21.017
They're just hungry.

00:05:21.277 --> 00:05:23.198
And also, that's for bears.

00:05:24.618 --> 00:05:26.518
Good. Now I know it'll work.
Tom!

00:05:26.778 --> 00:05:28.498
I'm kidding. I'm just gonna
use it to scare 'em.

00:05:29.417 --> 00:05:30.417
Possibly to death.

00:05:30.478 --> 00:05:31.478
Love you, honey, bye!
Tom--

00:05:36.213 --> 00:05:38.598
D-I-V-O-R-C-E.

00:05:40.848 --> 00:05:42.348
Okay, I'm in.

00:05:42.728 --> 00:05:44.707
With minimal damage
to Donut Lord's property.

00:05:46.127 --> 00:05:47.127
Here we go.

00:05:47.167 --> 00:05:48.647
It didn't work out on Earth,
but that's okay.

00:05:48.967 --> 00:05:50.267
You're going to a safe world.

00:05:50.488 --> 00:05:52.647
A nice, safe world
full of mushrooms.

00:05:53.147 --> 00:05:55.748
Mushrooms that'll be
your only friends.

00:05:56.307 --> 00:05:58.127
That sounds awful.
I can't do this.

00:05:58.307 --> 00:05:59.927
You have to do it.
There's no other option.

00:06:02.547 --> 00:06:03.547
[exhales] All right.

00:06:05.618 --> 00:06:07.258
SFPD...
pending background check.

00:06:07.618 --> 00:06:08.618
Paws in the air!

00:06:11.097 --> 00:06:12.457
Uh, meow?

00:06:12.571 --> 00:06:13.760
[screams]

00:06:13.875 --> 00:06:16.598
[screaming]

00:06:18.515 --> 00:06:19.934
Ow!

00:06:21.698 --> 00:06:24.478
"San... Francisco?"

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:34.374
[gun clatters]

00:06:36.996 --> 00:06:38.745
[moans]

00:06:46.893 --> 00:06:49.551
No.
[groans]

00:06:52.978 --> 00:06:53.978
What?

